{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1033057-thralls-from-d-tf-and-the-paradigm-of-sorcery","id":1033057,"title":"Thralls from D:tF and the paradigm of sorcery.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-16T17:52:57-08:00","id":1033057,"title":"Thralls from D:tF and the paradigm of sorcery.","content":"I am looking for inspiration for a paradigm for sorcery that was developed by and for Thralls from Demon the Fallen. Each style of sorcery carries with it something unique and I want thralls who are fully in the know and working to serve their demonic masters to have their own sorcery style and practice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T18:18:47-08:00","id":1033073,"title":"","content":"I do not think that many Sorcerers would be Thralls. It would be more thematically appropriate for a Sorcerer to engage in a Soul Pact with a Demon Lord and become an Infernal Sorcerer. It is much more beneficial for a Sorcerer to be an Infernal Sorcerers rather than to be a Thrall Sorcerer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T20:00:44-08:00","id":1033107,"title":"","content":"This is to flavor the world I am creating with impressive and interesting NPCs. The gist is that the Fallen have been out for a while and that handing out Occult 5 and +2 Int like candy to thralls has allowed them to cultivate their own fledgling hedge wizards. Now I want a semi religious paradigm for the thralls to channel their magic. Obviously Enochian will be used, but what else should I do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T22:06:39-08:00","id":1033152,"title":"","content":"No, I think that Enochian would be odd because it is the language of angels. By their fallen nature, the Demons of DtF lack even the capability of normal humans to speak or understand Enochian. At least that would be consistent with Hermetic lore from my reading.<br /> <br /> The real weakness of Thralls is that the Thralls of DtF cannot compete with Fomori Sorcerers, much less Infernal Sorcerers. Thrall Sorcerers would just be rather fragile. And +2 Intelligence and Occult 5 is really not that special for Sorcerers, Fomori Sorcerers can reach Intelligence 8 and Occult 5 while Infernal Sorcerers can reach Intelligence 8 and Occult 10.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","user":"Aya Tari","date":". 01-17-2017, 01:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T06:09:00-08:00","id":1033294,"title":"","content":"Demons speak Enochean like a first language because that's what it is to them. It might be different than the Hermetics version because this is the REAL Enochian, just as they are the real demons. And let's forget about the other sorcerers for a second. Having a trait at 5 is uber rare in real life and having a bunch of mortals together with Int 4-5 and Occult 5 should produce some interesting results.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}